   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"2\">\n    <li>Choose the quadratic equation that is represented by the graph.</li>\n  </ol>\n  <p><img height=\"166\" src=\"exercises/media/ad9c7192f76758ac.svg\" width=\"268\" alt=\"A line graph shows a blue curve plotted against x and y axes. The x-axis is labeled with points D0, D1, D4, D2, D3, and D5. The curve fluctuates, starting low, increasing, decreasing below the x-axis, then rising again.\"></p>",
